# Reviewer auto-assignment for the OmniMed3D monorepo.
# Mapping mirrors CONTRIBUTING.md #4.3 (Pull Request Process) —
# update both together if ownership changes.
#
# Order matters: later patterns override earlier ones for a given path.

/engine/         @nowead
/viewer/         @nowead
/dicom-parser/   @nowead

/ai-pipeline/  @hyuniverse
/infra/        @hyuniverse

