# series consumed by engine/viewer's "Load Demo CT" button, and
# available for ai-pipeline to reuse rather than maintaining a separate
# local-only download of the same patient) -- one owner maintains the
# committed files, same "shared, not one module's alone" pattern as
# dicom-parser/ above. See test-data/lidc_idri/README.md.
/test-data/  @nowead

